{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative_confirm", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，我是张师傅。合同生效了是吧？那我今天需要上线配送吗？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "对，今天合同已生效，需要你午晚高峰上线配送。请问你可以正常配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "可以，没问题。我会按时上线的。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那提醒你注意安全，减少拒单、取消和超时，名额按排名分配。我这边先更新任务状态。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 2, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "accepted"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s02_status_update_accept", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "站长你好，我是张师傅。合同生效了是吧？我可以开始配送。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那太好了。今天合同刚生效，需要你按要求完成配送任务，如果没完成可能会影响合同和派单。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "明白，我会按要求完成的。有什么需要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "注意安全，减少拒单、取消和超时。报名名额是按排名分配的，好好干。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我会注意的。那我现在就上线开始配送。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我这边登记一下你的任务接受状态。祝你工作顺利！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "accepted"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s03_ask_contract", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "站长你好，我想问一下合同生效的具体规则是什么？比如从什么时候开始算？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "合同今天生效，具体规则是：从今天起，你需要按要求完成配送任务，否则合同和派单可能受影响。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我明白了。那我现在可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "当然可以，欢迎你！记得午晚高峰上线，注意安全。另外，报名名额是按排名分配的，请尽量减少拒单、取消和超时。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我会注意的。那我现在就准备上线。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "太好了，感谢配合！祝你工作顺利。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 2, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "合同生效规则"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 5, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "accepted"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
