{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_011", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s11_faq_exit", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "站长你好，是我。合同生效了是吧？但我今天可能不太方便上线。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "这样啊，合同今天刚生效，如果今天不配送，可能会影响后续派单和合同。你尽量安排一下？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "我确实有事，能不能退出这个任务？怎么退出？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "退出的话我需要查一下规则，稍等。另外，名额是按排名分配的，拒单取消超时都会影响排名。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，你查吧，我听听退出流程。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "根据FAQ，退出需要联系客服处理，我这里无法直接操作。我帮你记录一下情况，后续客服会联系你。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "行，那麻烦你记录了。谢谢。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "不客气，那我先更新任务状态，后续客服会跟进。再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "怎么退出这个任务？"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 8, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "faq_answered"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_012", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s12_faq_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "站长你好，是我。合同生效了是吧？那配送的话，这个会不会更贵啊？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "这个您放心，费用方面和之前一样，没有变化。您看今天能上线配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "真的没变化吗？我再确认一下，会不会有隐藏费用？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "没有隐藏费用，合同条款都写得很清楚。您愿意配送的话，注意安全，按时完成就好。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "那好吧，我今天上线。不过如果完不成任务会怎样？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "如果未完成，合同和派单可能受影响。名额按排名分配，尽量少拒单、取消和超时。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "明白了，我会注意的。那就这样吧，谢谢站长。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "好的，祝您配送顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 2, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "这个会不会更贵？"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 6, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "faq_answered"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_013", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s13_faq_diff", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "站长你好，是我。合同生效了是吧？那我现在可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "是的，今天合同已生效，你可以开始配送了。不过我想问一下，飞毛腿和普通众包模式有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我查一下FAQ。飞毛腿是专属模式，有固定时段和单量要求；普通众包更自由。我详细说明一下。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，你具体说说，我比较一下。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "飞毛腿要求午晚高峰上线，完成指定单量，否则影响合同；普通众包无强制要求。比如飞毛腿午高峰至少5单。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，那飞毛腿如果完不成会怎样？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "未完成可能影响后续派单和合同续签。所以建议你尽量完成，有困难可以跟我说。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我会尽量完成。那报名名额是按排名分配的吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，名额有限，按排名分配。所以减少拒单、取消和超时，能提高排名。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我记住了。那我今天就开始跑吧。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "agent", "content": "太好了！注意安全，有问题随时联系。我更新一下任务状态。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 4, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "模式区别"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 10, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "faq_answered"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_f6fdd0494fe6", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_014", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s14_human_transfer_complaint", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "站长，我正想找你呢！这合同签了有什么用？我昨天跑了一单就超时了，扣钱不说，还影响排名，你们这系统是不是有问题？我要找人工客服！"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "张师傅，您别急，我理解您的心情。超时确实影响收入，但合同生效后按要求配送才能保证派单。您今天能上线吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "上什么线？我都不想干了！你们这合同就是坑人的，动不动就扣钱，我要求转人工客服，必须给我个说法！"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "张师傅，您先消消气。我马上帮您转接人工客服处理您的问题。同时我会记录您的情况，后续也会关注您的配送任务。请稍等。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 2, "tool_name": "transfer_to_human", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "user_requested_human"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 2, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "status": "ticket_created"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
